{"seq":2,"slug":"metric-imperial-conversion-factor","title":"公制/英制换算因子与精度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/unit-measure-packsize-conversion/uom-masterdata/metric-imperial-conversion-factor","wordCount":2314,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"公制-英制换算因子与精度\">公制/英制换算因子与精度</h1><p>换算因子看起来是最不需要设计的东西——一个常数，存下来就行。但这类系统的线上事故，相当一部分来自这颗常数：有人把 0.45359237 写成了 0.4536，有人用 float 存它导致 100 万件之后差了 3 千克，有人存了 6 位小数却要求&quot;按磅单价乘千克数量&quot;的精度到分。因子本身是对的制度问题、精度是数值问题、取整是会计问题，三件事必须分开处理。</p>\n<p>上一篇 <a href=\"base-sales-uom-definition\">基本单位/销售单位与单位族定义</a> 确立了单位有族、有维度；本篇处理族内的那条数值桥——它从哪来、存几位、什么时候可以取整。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>换算因子不是&quot;一个数&quot;，而是三元组：<strong>数值</strong>、<strong>来源等级</strong>（定义值 / 派生值 / 测量值）、<strong>适用精度</strong>。来源等级决定它能否参与精确等值断言，精度决定它要存几位、在哪一步取整。把这三者拆开，是避免&quot;库里的因子与展示的因子不是同一个&quot;这类问题的前提。</p>\n<p>判断一个因子属于哪个等级只需要问一句：<strong>它是由定义固定，还是由测量得到</strong>。英寸等于 0.0254 米是定义，任何偏差都是错的；某种散装物料的密度是测量，任何&quot;精确相等&quot;的断言都是错的。系统对这两类数值必须采取不同的策略——前者可以放在唯一约束与精确比较里，后者只能放在带容差的近似比较里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"因子的三种来源等级\">因子的三种来源等级</h2><h3 id=\"定义值-法律或标准规定的精确值\">定义值：法律或标准规定的精确值</h3><p>有些因子不是测量结果，而是<strong>由定义固定</strong>的。1959 年国际码磅协定之后，英寸被定义为精确的 0.0254 米，英尺为 0.3048 米——NIST SP 811 的附录 B 用粗体标注这些&quot;精确&quot;因子（<a href=\"https://www.nist.gov/pml/special-publication-811/nist-guide-si-appendix-b-conversion-factors/nist-guide-si-appendix-b9\">NIST SP 811 Appendix B.9</a>）。这类值可以无限精确地参与计算，不需要讨论&quot;测量误差&quot;。</p>\n<p>与之相对，磅到千克的因子 0.4535924 在 NIST 表中是<strong>非粗体</strong>的列表值——它是 0.45359237 的四舍五入形式。工程上应当采用国际码磅协定定义的 1 lb = 0.45359237 kg 这个精确关系，而不是表里印出来的 7 位版本。</p>\n<h3 id=\"约定值-行业惯用的近似\">约定值：行业惯用的近似</h3><p>另一些因子是约定俗成的近似：1 美制加仑 = 3.785412 L 在 NIST 表中同样是列表值，而它的精确定义其实来自 1 gal = 231 in³ 这一与英寸定义联动的精确关系。差别在第六位小数，对大多数业务无感，但对<strong>大批量贸易结算</strong>会产生可观的差额。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>量</th>\n<th>英制单位</th>\n<th>精确/列表值</th>\n<th>NIST 表中的性质</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>长度</td>\n<td>inch → m</td>\n<td>0.0254</td>\n<td>精确（粗体）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长度</td>\n<td>foot → m</td>\n<td>0.3048</td>\n<td>精确（粗体）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>质量</td>\n<td>lb → kg</td>\n<td>0.45359237</td>\n<td>由国际码磅协定定义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>质量</td>\n<td>oz → g</td>\n<td>28.349523125</td>\n<td>派生自 lb（1/16 lb）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>体积</td>\n<td>US gal → L</td>\n<td>3.785411784</td>\n<td>派生自 231 in³</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>体积</td>\n<td>US fl oz → mL</td>\n<td>29.5735295625</td>\n<td>派生自 gal（1/128）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>密度</td>\n<td>lb/ft³ → kg/m³</td>\n<td>16.01846337</td>\n<td>派生自 lb 与 ft</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>工程结论很简单：<strong>因子应存精确有理值或它的小数展开，不要存标准文档里印出来的截断版本</strong>。库里那一列是 18 位小数，展示层才做取整。</p>\n<h3 id=\"测量值-不可约的近似\">测量值：不可约的近似</h3><p>第三类因子来自测量，无法精确化——比如按密度把体积折算成质量时用到的商品密度。这类值的误差来源不是换算而是<strong>物理性质本身</strong>，因此必须带误差范围或有效期，并且不能参与&quot;精确等值&quot;的断言。这也是为什么 <a href=\"../uom-pricing-inventory/catch-weight-variable-weight\">按重量计价/可变重量商品</a> 里的折算永远只用于估算，实际结算以称重为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"精度-因子位数与运算位数的分离\">精度：因子位数与运算位数的分离</h2><h3 id=\"因子存储位数\">因子存储位数</h3><p>因子列的位数决定了换算的理论误差上界。用 <code>numeric(38,18)</code> 存，相对误差在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>18</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{-18}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">18</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 量级，远超任何业务的货币精度需求；真正的问题不在存储，而在每次换算都做一次乘法会累积舍入。</p>\n<p>一个更稳的做法是<strong>只在换算链的末端取整一次</strong>，中间全程保留全精度。这与 BIPM 对数值表达的指导一致：取整应在<strong>单次操作</strong>中完成，使用未取整的中间值；BIPM 给出的例子是 2.349 保留一位小数应为 2.3，而先取到 2.35 再取到 2.4 是错的（<a href=\"https://www.bipm.org/documents/20126/41483022/SI-Brochure-9-EN.pdf\">BIPM SI Brochure 9th ed.</a>）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"取整模式\">取整模式</h3><p>BIPM 给出的规则实质上是&quot;round half to even&quot;（末位为偶则不进位）：被舍去首位小于 5 则保留；大于 5 则进一；恰为 5 且后面非零则进一；恰为 5 或 5 后全零则取偶。这套规则与 IEEE 754 的默认舍入模式一致——IEEE 754-2019 规定的默认行为就是二进制下的&quot;round to nearest, ties to even&quot;（<a href=\"https://standards.ieee.org/ieee/754/6210/\">IEEE 754-2019</a>）。</p>\n<p>但在<strong>交易金额</strong>上，绝大多数货币与税务规则要求 half-up（四舍五入），而不是 half-even。这两种规则在小数末位为 5 时结果不同，因此必须在系统里显式声明：数量换算用 half-even（符合计量标准），货币取整用 half-up（符合财税惯例）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[源数量 q, 源单位 u1] --&gt; B[因子 f = factor/u1_to_base]&#10;  B --&gt; C[基准量 qb = q * f&lt;br/&gt;全精度 numeric]&#10;  C --&gt; D{换算用途?}&#10;  D --&gt;|数量/库存| E[half-even 到目标精度]&#10;  D --&gt;|金额计价| F[half-up 到货币精度]&#10;  D --&gt;|报关申报| G[按海关规定位数&lt;br/&gt;通常 0 位小数或按法定精度]&#10;  E --&gt; H[残差 = qb - 取整后反算]&#10;  F --&gt; H&#10;  G --&gt; H\">graph TD\n  A[源数量 q, 源单位 u1] --&gt; B[因子 f = factor/u1_to_base]\n  B --&gt; C[基准量 qb = q * f&lt;br/&gt;全精度 numeric]\n  C --&gt; D{换算用途?}\n  D --&gt;|数量/库存| E[half-even 到目标精度]\n  D --&gt;|金额计价| F[half-up 到货币精度]\n  D --&gt;|报关申报| G[按海关规定位数&lt;br/&gt;通常 0 位小数或按法定精度]\n  E --&gt; H[残差 = qb - 取整后反算]\n  F --&gt; H\n  G --&gt; H</pre><h2 id=\"双向因子的自洽性\">双向因子的自洽性</h2><p>一个容易忽略的性质：换算必须<strong>双向自洽到业务可接受的程度</strong>。若 <code>kg → lb</code> 用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2.20462262</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_1 = 2.20462262</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.20462262</span></span></span></span></span>，而 <code>lb → kg</code> 用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.45359237</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_2 = 0.45359237</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.45359237</span></span></span></span></span>，那么 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_1 \\times f_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是否恰好等于 1，取决于两者的存储精度。工程上应当<strong>只存单向因子</strong>，反向换算用 <code>1/f</code> 计算，避免维护两个可能不一致的常数。</p>\n<p>这条纪律的检验方式是一次往返测试：对每个单位对，取一组边界值（很小、很大、精度敏感值），做 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_1 \\to u_2 \\to u_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的往返，断言结果与原始值之差不超过给定容差。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;conversion_policy&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;factor_storage&quot;: { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;NUMERIC&quot;, &quot;scale&quot;: 18 },&#10;    &quot;rounding&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;quantity&quot;: &quot;HALF_EVEN&quot;,&#10;      &quot;money&quot;: &quot;HALF_UP&quot;,&#10;      &quot;customs_declaration&quot;: &quot;PER_AUTHORITY&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;rounding_points&quot;: &quot;END_OF_CHAIN_ONLY&quot;,&#10;    &quot;bidirectional&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;store&quot;: &quot;FORWARD_ONLY&quot;,&#10;      &quot;reverse&quot;: &quot;RECIPROCAL_OF_FORWARD&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;roundtrip_tolerance&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;relative&quot;: 1e-12,&#10;      &quot;absolute_for_count&quot;: 0&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;prohibited&quot;: [&quot;binary_float_for_factor&quot;, &quot;double_rounding&quot;, &quot;two_independent_constants_per_pair&quot;]&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"conversion_policy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"factor_storage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"NUMERIC\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"scale\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"rounding\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"quantity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"HALF_EVEN\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"money\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"HALF_UP\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"customs_declaration\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PER_AUTHORITY\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"rounding_points\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"END_OF_CHAIN_ONLY\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"bidirectional\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"store\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FORWARD_ONLY\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"reverse\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"RECIPROCAL_OF_FORWARD\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"roundtrip_tolerance\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"relative\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1e-12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"absolute_for_count\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"prohibited\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"binary_float_for_factor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"double_rounding\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"two_independent_constants_per_pair\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>absolue_for_count</code> 那条为 0 是刻意的：计数单位之间不存在换算误差，任何往返偏差都说明实现有 bug，必须精确相等。</p>\n<h2 id=\"精度在长换算链上的累积\">精度在长换算链上的累积</h2><p>一次卖到报关，数量可能经历&quot;磅 → 千克 → 克 → 报关千克&quot;这样的链。如果每一跳都取整，误差会叠加，且方向可能一致（系统性偏大或偏小）。风险最高的是<strong>向下取整用于计价</strong>：每次取整都让消费者多得一点或少付一点，长期看会被计量监管认定为系统性缺斤短两。</p>\n<p>正确的处理是让换算链<strong>只在末端取整一次</strong>，并把被舍掉的部分作为残差显式记录，而不是让它消失在某个中间步骤里。残差的归属规则与对账方式，是 <a href=\"../uom-customs-rounding/uom-rounding-residual-control\">单位换算四舍五入与残差控制</a> 的主题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"因子的落地表\">因子的落地表</h2><h3 id=\"一张表存全部因子\">一张表存全部因子</h3><p>因子表的关键设计是<strong>以族基准单位为锚</strong>，而非任意两单位之间的两两配对。这样 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个单位只需要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 条因子，而不是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n(n-1)/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span> 条，且任意两单位之间的换算因子都可从锚点导出。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE uom_factor (&#10;  uom_code       text PRIMARY KEY REFERENCES uom(uom_code),&#10;  family_code    text NOT NULL,&#10;  -- 相对同族基准单位的因子&#10;  factor_to_base numeric(38,18) NOT NULL CHECK (factor_to_base &gt; 0),&#10;  factor_kind    text NOT NULL,     -- DEFINED / DERIVED / MEASURED&#10;  source_ref     text NOT NULL,     -- 标准文档编号或出处&#10;  effective_from date NOT NULL,&#10;  CONSTRAINT chk_kind CHECK (&#10;    factor_kind IN (&#39;DEFINED&#39;,&#39;DERIVED&#39;,&#39;MEASURED&#39;))&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 任意两单位换算因子：派生，不落库&#10;CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION uom_convert_factor(p_from text, p_to text)&#10;RETURNS numeric AS $$&#10;DECLARE&#10;  f1 numeric(38,18); f2 numeric(38,18);&#10;  fam1 text; fam2 text;&#10;BEGIN&#10;  SELECT factor_to_base, family_code INTO f1, fam1&#10;    FROM uom_factor WHERE uom_code = p_from;&#10;  SELECT factor_to_base, family_code INTO f2, fam2&#10;    FROM uom_factor WHERE uom_code = p_to;&#10;  IF fam1 IS NULL OR fam2 IS NULL THEN&#10;    RAISE EXCEPTION &#39;unknown uom: % -&gt; %&#39;, p_from, p_to;&#10;  END IF;&#10;  IF fam1 &lt;&gt; fam2 THEN&#10;    RAISE EXCEPTION &#39;cross-family conversion % (% -&gt; %)&#39;,&#10;      p_from, fam1, fam2;&#10;  END IF;&#10;  RETURN f1 / f2;&#10;END;&#10;$$ LANGUAGE plpgsql IMMUTABLE;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> uom_factor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  uom_code       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> uom(uom_code),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  family_code    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  -- 相对同族基准单位的因子</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  factor_to_base </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">38</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (factor_to_base </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  factor_kind    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- DEFINED / DERIVED / MEASURED</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source_ref     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 标准文档编号或出处</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_from </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chk_kind </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    factor_kind </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'DEFINED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'DERIVED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'MEASURED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 任意两单位换算因子：派生，不落库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE OR REPLACE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FUNCTION</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> uom_convert_factor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(p_from </span>